# Stock Caddy, the upstream release Veld ships unchanged. One line per platform
# Veld releases for: the SHA-512 caddyserver/caddy published for it, and the
# archive name, which carries the version. `scripts/release/fetch-caddy.sh` reads
# this file and refuses an archive whose hash is not written here.
#
# To move to a newer Caddy, replace all four lines from that release's
# caddy_<version>_checksums.txt — never one alone:
#
#   gh release download v<version> -R caddyserver/caddy -p 'caddy_<version>_checksums.txt'
#
# Nothing bumps this file automatically, so a Caddy security release reaches
# Veld only when someone edits it.
